     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Update ver1.6 is now available.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "■ 5 New Languages",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "简体中文 (Simplified Chinese)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Русский (Russian)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Português (Brasil) (Brazilian Portuguese)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Deutsch (German)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Español (Latinoamérica) (Latin American Spanish): The in-game text — menus, dialogue, After Talks, endings, the manual, bonus images, and more — has been translated. You can switch languages anytime from Setting → Language, and on first launch the game now automatically matches your Steam language setting.: *Some images, such as the title logo and the staff roll, remain in English.: ■ Improvements from the PS5 Version",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Added an animated company logo at startup",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added trail effects to the Liner Shot, Comet, Tres, and the boss's comet",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Refreshed the look of the other-dimension blocks at the start of stages (pattern and glowing edges)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a guard barrier and slow-motion effect when Blocking",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rudymical: the rhythm now follows the music's playback position so it no longer drifts, a timing ring was added, and fixed an issue where some songs could not be progressed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Syegacha: the results of an 11-pull are now shown on one screen, and L/R button marks were added for turning gallery pages: ■ Bug Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where the achievement \"ZIZOU’s TWEETS\" could unlock without its conditions being met when clearing Riva's story",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed memory usage growing each time images were reloaded, such as when changing screen settings: Thank you for your continued support of The Legend of Dark Witch series!: INSIDE SYSTEM",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
